<https://w3id.org/heritagegraph/KumariRole> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role/office of Kumari (living-goddess embodiment) that a person assumes for the duration of a KumariTenure. The role is the type; the tenure is the time-bounded holding of it; the person is the holder."@en .
<https://w3id.org/heritagegraph/KumariLifecycleEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Abstract event that bounds a KumariTenure (selection, enthronement, or retirement). Each concrete subclass requires exactly one tenure edge via slot_usage: initiated_tenure (selection), ended_tenure_of (retirement), or bounds_tenure itself (enthronement)."@en .
